VoxCPM Studio includes code derived from OpenBMB/VoxCPM.

Upstream project:
- Repository: https://github.com/OpenBMB/VoxCPM
- License: Apache License 2.0

This repository keeps the upstream Apache-2.0 license and adds local studio,
deployment, and workflow management changes on top of that codebase snapshot.

Model weights are not distributed in this repository. Download official weights
from Hugging Face, for example:
- https://huggingface.co/openbmb/VoxCPM2
